    art: 
    arrival: 'Tobias[sad]: Is Pip here? Pip said this was a nice hotel.

      Not
      the dark rooms. And NOT the cellar. Something scratches down there.'
    story:
    - 'Tobias[sad]: I followed Pip into the lake that day. I was only trying to help
      with the kite.'
    - 'Tobias: The scratching in the cellar is a dog. MY dog. Biscuit waited for
      me all this time.'
    - 'Tobias[happy]: Biscuit remembered me! We''re going to find Pip together.'
    checkout: 'Tobias[happy]: Here''s Biscuit''s old collar. He says thanks for the
